# `/public/build` is deliberately NOT ignored.
#
# The production host is Hostinger shared hosting, which has no Node, so
# the Vite bundle cannot be built there. It is built on a developer machine
# and shipped with the code — which means it has to be in the repository.
#
# The cost is real and worth naming: every `npm run build` produces a large
# diff of hashed asset files, and two people building the same source will
# produce different hashes. If this ever moves to a host that can run its
# own build, ignore this directory again and delete it from history.

/public/hot
/public/storage
/storage/*.key
/storage/pail
/vendor
